  "description": "Etsy Open API v3. Bearer OAuth access token (operator refreshes) plus required x-api-key header (keystring:shared_secret) on every request since 2026-02-09. extraHeaders sends x-api-key from config api_key and shared_secret. No scraping etsy.com. Receipts are the official order object. Inbound webhooks: selecting the :listen operation (trigger) via webhook_key ($webhookKeyRef) blocks the canvas INPUT port and compiles as a webhook-triggered Message Start (or binds to any Activity's MESSAGE Boundary Event). Docs: https://developer.etsy.com/documentation/essentials/requests",
